          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_stationarity_assumption_requiring_st",
          "text": "This is the stationarity assumption, requiring the state transition and reward functions to stay fixed over time. In the real world, that rarely holds.",
