          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_robotics_healthcare_digital_marketin",
          "text": "Robotics, healthcare, and digital marketing all drift over long horizons, and a policy learned as if the world were frozen quietly becomes suboptimal, sometimes even harmful.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
