          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_problem_tackles_how_reliably_tell",
          "text": "The problem this paper tackles is how to reliably tell whether an offline decision-making system is actually stationary before you trust the policy it produced.",
