          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_why_does_matter_now_consider",
          "text": "Why does this matter now? Consider the Intern Health Study, a year-long mobile-health trial that nudges first-year physicians toward healthier habits through push notifications.",
