          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_effect_those_nudges_wanes_over",
          "text": "The effect of those nudges wanes over time, a textbook case of non-stationarity. Similar drift shows up in traffic signal control, where flow patterns swing between peak and off-peak hours.",
